              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukuba uwafumine ku mutuulo wa cakutambika wafinine amatalanta amakumi cine lubali (70) na mashekeli amakana yabili ne myanda ine (2,400)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
