          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo ne fyakwimikamo inceshi sha ku lupango lwa lubansa ne sha pa mwinshi wa lupango lwa lubansa ne mpopo sha kwi Itenti lyakwa Lesa shonse ne sha ku lubansa lonse ulwa cipango.",
